The GPL-3.0-or-later userspace is mostly copyright André Eikmeyer. 4f1sh3r
holds the copyright of his contributions, in particular large parts of the
auto-installer, the macOS, test, CI and Fedora scripts, and his contributions
to t2-fan-control and t2-smc-control. Every contributor keeps the copyright of
their own contributions. Other components credit their own authors in their
files and directories, the git history has the full list of contributors.
